{"1112630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lost Vulcan", "steam_appid": 1112630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/57ccb92552eeb536a210ec4386bb1c6c.avif?t=1786723332\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The legend of the Vulcan is calling. Will you answer?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in uncharted space drifts the Vulcan — a colossal abandoned ship holding legendary riches, lethal traps, and foes that will push even veteran treasure hunters past their limits. Everyone who went looking is still out there. You're going anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/ca31b234a2c09c8f1d00ff22dd5b6539.poster.avif?t=1786723332\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/ca31b234a2c09c8f1d00ff22dd5b6539.webm?t=1786723332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/ca31b234a2c09c8f1d00ff22dd5b6539.mp4?t=1786723332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/035d8fa1f64b4f9083b8e5407539aded.avif?t=1786723332\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the art of arcade survival:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Precision controls</strong> — classic arcade feel with the depth of a modern roguelite.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>6 unique zones</strong> packed with clever traps and ruthless enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 <strong>7 epic bosses</strong> that punish every bad habit you've picked up.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/1ab46d56cbfeae9094c5d8d7a800ecbd.poster.avif?t=1786723332\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/1ab46d56cbfeae9094c5d8d7a800ecbd.webm?t=1786723332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/1ab46d56cbfeae9094c5d8d7a800ecbd.mp4?t=1786723332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔄 <strong>180 handcrafted levels</strong>, dealt in a different order every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ <strong>Local multiplayer</strong> — team up in co-op or settle it in versus mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/965b07210dbb2365b44cc35a9af1b60e.poster.avif?t=1786723332\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/965b07210dbb2365b44cc35a9af1b60e.webm?t=1786723332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/965b07210dbb2365b44cc35a9af1b60e.mp4?t=1786723332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔓 <strong>Addictive progression</strong> — unlock new characters and upgrades run after run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Leaderboards</strong> — chase the high score on every descent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 <strong>Chiptune soundtrack</strong> straight from gaming's golden age.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Lost Vulcan, every jump and every shot is the difference between glory... and a very short career.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/7b4474bbf9ba9d849f8a1e809946ae70.poster.avif?t=1786723332\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/7b4474bbf9ba9d849f8a1e809946ae70.webm?t=1786723332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/7b4474bbf9ba9d849f8a1e809946ae70.mp4?t=1786723332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you willing to risk it all for the treasure?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/57ccb92552eeb536a210ec4386bb1c6c.avif?t=1786723332\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The legend of the Vulcan is calling. Will you answer?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in uncharted space drifts the Vulcan — a colossal abandoned ship holding legendary riches, lethal traps, and foes that will push even veteran treasure hunters past their limits. Everyone who went looking is still out there. You're going anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/ca31b234a2c09c8f1d00ff22dd5b6539.poster.avif?t=1786723332\" width=780 height=2