sus mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/965b07210dbb2365b44cc35a9af1b60e.poster.avif?t=1786723332\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/965b07210dbb2365b44cc35a9af1b60e.webm?t=1786723332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/965b07210dbb2365b44cc35a9af1b60e.mp4?t=1786723332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔓 <strong>Addictive progression</strong> — unlock new characters and upgrades run after run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Leaderboards</strong> — chase the high score on every descent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 <strong>Chiptune soundtrack</strong> straight from gaming's golden age.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Lost Vulcan, every jump and every shot is the difference between glory... and a very short career.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/7b4474bbf9ba9d849f8a1e809946ae70.poster.avif?t=1786723332\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/7b4474bbf9ba9d849f8a1e809946ae70.webm?t=1786723332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112630/extras/7b4474bbf9ba9d849f8a1e809946ae70.mp4?t=1786723332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you willing to risk it all for the treasure?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Lost Vulcan